_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nI am using your RSS feed https://dev.to/feed/itnext in one of my applications. From december 2021 i started to get errors from my application that the RSS feed is incorrect.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n\r\nOpen the RSS feed in a browser and it looks not quite the same as other feeds.\r\n\r\n1. Open https://dev.to/feed/itnext in browser and compare to for instance this RSS feed https://itnext.io/feed.\r\n2. The structure is not correct\r\n\r\nAnother way to validate is using the feed validator : https://validator.w3.org/feed/.\r\nFill in the faulty feed and it replies the feed is not valid. Fill in an example of a correct feed and it will correctly validate.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nI expect the feed to be well constructed.\r\n\r\nPlease repair the feed so i can use it again in my application.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\n\r\nDiana van Eijk","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/16418/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/16418/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}